Q21: Which syntax is used to embed a variable inside a template literal?
A) #variable
B) ${variable}
C) %variable%
D) {variable}
Answer: B

Q53: How do you create an object from the class Car?
A) let myCar = Car.new("Toyota");
B) let myCar = Car.create("Toyota");
C) let myCar = new Car("Toyota");
D) let myCar = Car("Toyota");
Answer: C

Q56: Which of the following is an arrow function?
A) function() {}
B) [] => {}
C) () -> {}
D) () => {}
Answer: D

Q65: How do you declare a function in JavaScript?
A) function myFunc() {}
B) const myFunc = function() {}
C) const myFunc = () => {}
D) All of the above
Answer: D

